# Agent context exclusions
#
# Advisory vendor-neutral list for AI agents and external reviewers.
# Codex-specific indexing should also read `.codexignore`.
# This file is not a security boundary: agents may still read an excluded path
# when an approved objective explicitly requires it.

.git/
node_modules/
web/node_modules/
admin/node_modules/
.next/
web/.next/
admin/.next/
dist/
build/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

*.log
logs/
data/*.csv
05_ai/runs/*.json
05_ai/runs/*.approval.md

.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12

.cache/
.codex/
.npm-cache/
.playwright-browsers/
.playwright-cli/
.qwen/
.roo/
output/
web/.npm-cache/
web/test-results/

frontend_mvp/
docs/reports/git/stash-backups/*.patch
docs/reports/qwen/
DOCS_REVIEW.md
